Package: rsemverse
Type: Package
Title: Read RSEM Gene-Level Results as Gene Symbol Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daiki", "Kumakura", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "55353329+DaikiKumakura@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Reads RSEM '*.genes.results' files listed in a sample table and
    returns a data frame of expected counts or TPM with one row per gene
    symbol and one column per sample. Symbols come from the Bioconductor
    organism annotation packages 'org.Hs.eg.db' (human) and 'org.Mm.eg.db'
    (mouse); Ensembl version suffixes are removed before the lookup and rows
    that share a symbol are summed.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://daikikumakura.github.io/rsemverse/,
    https://github.com/DaikiKumakura/rsemverse
BugReports: https://github.com/DaikiKumakura/rsemverse/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
biocViews: RNASeq, Transcriptomics
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    AnnotationDbi,
    data.table,
    utils
Suggests:
    knitr,
    org.Hs.eg.db,
    org.Mm.eg.db,
